						You can copy paste directly to this spreadsheet using excel or google docs.<br/>Press the import button when you're finished.
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
		<!--textarea class="paste_handler keydown_auto_focus" style="position: absolute;top:-1000px;max-height:100px;"></textarea-->
		<div class="module form paste_view view hidden">
			<div class="module_content list" style="text-align: center;vertical-align: middle;">
				<div style="margin-top: 160px;margin-bottom: 200px">
					<a class="download_template">Download the spreadsheet template.</a><br/>&nbsp;<br/>
